{
  title: "sum"
}
---
### NAME

    sum() - Calculates the sum of all elements in an array.

### SYNOPSIS

    int sum( int *arr );

### DESCRIPTION

    Calculates the sum of all elements in an array.

### PARAMETERS

    arr  (int*)
         The array of numbers to sum.

### RETURN VALUES

    (int) The sum of all elements in the array.
